            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added support for Firefox Nightly &amp; Safari Technical Preview</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Used <a href=\"https://codepen.io/editor/CodeRedDigital/pen/01a111b4-f26d-7c2b-8e12-965550d1d146\" rel=\"nofollow\">this pen</a> to test:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Nightly (159.0a1) - all passed</li>\n<li>Safari Tech Preview (252) - all passed</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46001\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/46001/hovercard\">Firefox Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30767",
            "title": "Support for `<corner-shape-value>` and `superellipse()` added Safari TP and FF Nightly",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-06T16:07:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-06T15:42:21.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dletorey",
                "url": "https://github.com/dletorey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12870451?u=53865490ebd18b730e5c7a1383496f38d641ab27&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">WebKit reverted the IME key event ordering fix and disabled InputMethodUsesCorrectKeyEventOrder by default again. This removes the Safari 27 full support entries for KeyboardEvent.isComposing and InputEvent.isComposing, so both remain marked as partially implemented.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/c30586a25111138c6b5e6e938edbd29e721274d9/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/c30586a25111138c6b5e6e938edbd29e721274d9\">WebKit/WebKit@<tt>c30586a</tt></a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4666623027\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/67186\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/67186/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/67186\">WebKit/WebKit#67186</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=317127\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=317127</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Current status: <a href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blame/main/Source/WTF/Scripts/Preferences/UnifiedWebPreferences.yaml#:~:text=InputMethodUsesCorrectKeyEventOrder\">https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blame/main/Source/WTF/Scripts/Preferences/UnifiedWebPreferences.yaml#:~:text=InputMethodUsesCorrectKeyEventOrder</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4837742155\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30009\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30009/hovercard?comment_id=6009578375&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30009#issuecomment-6009578375\">#30009 (comment)</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\">Summary &amp; changes were ghostwritten by GPT-6.1 Sol via Codex (The changes are so simple that whether GPT does them or I do, we get the exact same result).</p>\n</div>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30766",
