        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://collector.openwebdocs.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://collector.openwebdocs.org/</a> project (v10.20.12) found new features shipping in today's Chromium Canary.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>api.RTCPeerConnection.cancelDiagnosticLogging_static (<a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5091582546149376\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5091582546149376</a>)</li>\n<li>api.RTCPeerConnection.startDiagnosticLogging_static</li>\n<li>api.RTCPeerConnection.stopDiagnosticLogging_static</li>\n<li>api.WebTransport.responseHeaders (<a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5194104408506368\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5194104408506368</a>)</li>\n<li>css.properties.position-visibility.anchor-valid (<a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5136123851571200\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5136123851571200</a>)</li>\n<li>css.properties.position-visibility.anchor-visible</li>\n<li>css.properties.text-decoration-inset (<a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5178263526834176\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5178263526834176</a>)</li>\n<li>css.properties.text-decoration-inset.auto</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30757",
            "title": "Updates for Chrome Canary, 05 Oct 2026",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-05T16:39:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-05T16:38:43.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Elchi3",
                "url": "https://github.com/Elchi3"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The spec has been updated and new values have been added to simplify the sharing of random values.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">element-scoped</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-scoped</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-index-scoped</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">fixed &lt;number&gt;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Used <a href=\"https://codepen.io/editor/CodeRedDigital/pen/01a10c48-2a3a-760a-b650-b5e5bc8c6dde\" rel=\"nofollow\">this pen</a> to test:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Nightly (159.0a1) - all passed</li>\n<li>Chrome Canary (157.0.8086.0) - all passed</li>\n<li>Safari Tech Preview (252) - all passed</li>\n<li>Safari (27.0) - all passed, except <code class=\"notranslate\">property-scoped</code> &amp; <code class=\"notranslate\">property-index-scoped</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45729\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45729/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45997\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45997/hovercard\">Firefox Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30756",
            "title": "updated the `<random-key>` values for `random()`",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-06T15:23:03.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-05T15:44:36.000Z",
